<view class="page"><view class="eyebrow">CHINA GOLF DIRECTORY</view><view class="title">下一场，去哪里？</view><view class="sub">全国 {{total}} 条球场／分场资料 · 含港澳台</view><input class="space" placeholder="搜索球场、别名或城市" bindinput="search"/><picker range="{{provinces}}" bindchange="province"><view class="card">地区：{{province==='all'?'全部地区':province}} ▾</view></picker><view class="muted">全国资料采集于 2026-10-23，长三角保留已核对版本；非完整在营名录。未知值保持空白，开局前请核对现行版本。</view><view class="section">{{items.length}} 条球场记录</view><view wx:for="{{items}}" wx:key="id" class="card"><view style="font-size:31rpx;font-weight:600">{{item.name}}</view><view class="muted">{{item.province}} {{item.city}} · {{item.facts}}</view><view class="muted">{{item.availability}}</view><view class="row space"><text class="link" data-id="{{item.id}}" bindtap="details">资料与来源</text><button wx:if="{{item.canScore}}" class="primary" size="mini" data-id="{{item.id}}" bindtap="select">在这里记分</button></view></view></view>
